~ cautious
Narrator: I look at her more carefully. The way she stands, the way her antennae move—everything about her is foreign. Alien. Unknown.
{{Global.player_name}}: Okay, okay... just... where did you come from? What are you?
{{Global.player_name}}: And more importantly, what do you want?
Narrator: My voice sounds steady, but my heart is racing. She's clearly hurt, but I have no idea what she's capable of.
Girl: You cautious. I sense your uncertainty.
Girl: I want just refuge. Not be alone...
Narrator: There's something in the way she speaks. Almost... desperate.
=> cautious_options

~ cautious_options
