	{{Global.player_name}}: I want to help you, I really do. But this is too much for me. I can't deal with this.
	{{Global.player_name}}: I'm sorry.
	Narrator: I turn away, my chest tight with guilt.
	Girl: You choose to leave. Survival comes first.
