- [i]Come with me[/i]
	{{Global.player_name}}: Okay. I don't understand any of this, but you're hurt and you're scared. I get that much.
	{{Global.player_name}}: Let's get you inside. We'll figure it out from there.
	Girl: You help me?
	Narrator: She stands up slowly, wincing from the pain in her side.
	Girl: Thank you. I will not forget.
	Narrator: We start walking back toward my house. The night ahead is uncertain, but at least she won't be alone.
